tags: economic_policy

Your economic advisers propose freezing basic commodity prices and capping foreign debt payments at 10% of total export earnings.

- @enact_cap: Enact price freezes and the 10% foreign debt cap.
- @reject_cap: Reject price controls and pursue fiscal austerity.

